WEBVTT

00:15.670 --> 00:18.500
I never dreamed before

00:18.500 --> 00:21.340
I'm gonna knock the door

00:21.340 --> 00:24.910
into the world of perfect free

00:24.910 --> 00:27.010
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:27.010 --> 00:29.850
You're gonna say I'm lying

00:29.850 --> 00:32.580
I'm gonna get the chance

00:32.580 --> 00:36.150
I thought a chance is far from me

00:36.150 --> 00:37.320
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:37.320 --> 00:40.230
I was made to hit in America

00:40.230 --> 00:43.090
(I was made to hit in America)

00:43.090 --> 00:49.000
I was made to hit in America

00:49.000 --> 00:52.670
You are the sun, you are the star

00:52.670 --> 00:54.670
(To me, forever)

00:54.670 --> 00:58.380
You are the sun, you are the star

00:58.380 --> 01:01.610
(To me, forever)

01:08.450 --> 01:14.060
I was made to hit in America

01:14.060 --> 01:16.900
I was made to hit in America

01:16.900 --> 01:19.760
(I was made to hit in America)

01:19.760 --> 01:22.570
I was made to hit in America

01:22.570 --> 01:25.340
(I was made to hit in America)

01:25.340 --> 01:33.210
I was made to hit in America

01:52.930 --> 01:54.230
Huh?

01:55.600 --> 01:57.330
Did you get the shell?

01:59.600 --> 02:00.630
You?

02:03.280 --> 02:05.010
Just answer my question.

02:05.010 --> 02:06.610
It'll be all good.

02:06.610 --> 02:11.120
All the white dudes will be sad
if Eddy Lee's dead, right?

02:11.120 --> 02:14.290
For me, I don't give a fuck!

02:14.290 --> 02:15.950
Who told you to do this?

02:15.950 --> 02:18.460
Hey! Hey!

02:18.460 --> 02:19.790
I'm asking you!

02:19.790 --> 02:23.280
Where the fuck is this thing you stole?

02:26.630 --> 02:27.800
Say what?

02:27.800 --> 02:30.970
Whoa Eddy! Are you all right?

02:30.970 --> 02:35.310
Yeah. He took off right when
the security guys came in.

02:35.310 --> 02:37.910
I see. You are still lucky.

02:37.910 --> 02:40.250
I knew it! He found out everything.

02:40.250 --> 02:43.420
Can't be. How could he find out?

02:43.420 --> 02:45.250
Ray, the movie's done.

02:45.250 --> 02:48.250
Our tour movie, that Jim directed.

02:48.250 --> 02:49.250
Yeah?

02:49.250 --> 02:52.920
Yeah, they've been previewing it
a couple of times last week...

02:52.920 --> 02:53.930
What?

02:53.930 --> 02:57.760
Yeah, I told Jim to cut out
the scene of me playing, "Lucille."

02:57.760 --> 03:00.730
You know, he's an artist.

03:00.730 --> 03:01.720
Well...

03:03.270 --> 03:06.940
Yeah, it was the uh...
It was the scene of Koyuki.

03:06.940 --> 03:09.600
You know, singing really, really good.

03:20.550 --> 03:25.490
"Live 16 'Indies'"

03:43.570 --> 03:45.440
I'll come again!

03:46.580 --> 03:48.180
What's with that kid?

03:48.180 --> 03:51.080
He comes in everyday, smiling.
Gives me the creeps.

03:51.080 --> 03:57.090
I hear if you keep staring at a Telecaster,
it helps you endure even hard labor.

03:57.090 --> 03:58.920
Oh...

03:58.920 --> 04:00.150
But...

04:01.430 --> 04:03.790
He'd better make up his mind
or it'll be sold.

04:09.770 --> 04:12.770
Hey! Hey!

04:12.770 --> 04:14.610
Where're the spring rolls?!

04:14.610 --> 04:16.130
Oh sorry!

04:17.610 --> 04:20.450
Hey Tanaka! The dumplings are overdone.

04:20.450 --> 04:22.610
I just got a complaint.

04:22.610 --> 04:25.080
-I'm sorry!
-Hey, spring rolls!

04:25.080 --> 04:25.980
Right!

04:30.120 --> 04:31.690
Hey Tanaka!

04:31.690 --> 04:35.790
You didn't ladle the soup carefully!
The same customer is complaining!

04:35.790 --> 04:37.120
I'm sorry.

04:43.570 --> 04:46.400
Strange...I'm doing it properly.

04:46.400 --> 04:47.570
My goodness!

04:47.570 --> 04:53.080
-How many times must I complain
before you get things right?!
-I'm so sorry.

04:53.080 --> 04:59.420
-How can I pay for this?
-Huh? It's Saito-san...

04:59.420 --> 05:03.220
I thought they'd give me a free meal.

05:05.090 --> 05:09.260
-What a stingy shop.
-You're the stingy one!

05:09.260 --> 05:11.930
I'm counting on you for Tuesday.

05:11.930 --> 05:14.270
I have lots of deliveries.

05:14.270 --> 05:16.430
I guess I'll go to the bathhouse.

05:23.270 --> 05:25.900
Ouch!

05:35.620 --> 05:39.390
Maybe I'll go meet that girl who works
at the doughnut shop next door.

05:40.890 --> 05:44.230
Hey! Quit loafing and get back to work!

05:44.230 --> 05:45.960
Oh, sorry!

05:57.740 --> 06:00.080
He's so cool!

06:00.080 --> 06:03.250
Well, too bad! Yoshito belongs to me!

06:03.250 --> 06:05.750
No way! Yoshito's mine!

06:05.750 --> 06:08.480
-Hey!
-Excuse me!

06:09.390 --> 06:09.920
"Yoshito Morozumi"

06:09.920 --> 06:11.820
"Yoshito Morozumi"

06:09.920 --> 06:11.820
Is this guy popular?

06:11.820 --> 06:12.090
Is this guy popular?

06:12.090 --> 06:15.930
Are you serious? You don't
watch TV on Mondays at 8?

06:15.930 --> 06:18.360
It's a sad drama about
a short-distance runner.

06:18.360 --> 06:20.260
I sooo love it!

06:20.260 --> 06:25.100
Yoshito plays a young guy in
a wheelchair. And he's awesome.

06:26.800 --> 06:28.500
Oh...

06:34.110 --> 06:36.880
Good, we had a good crowd tonight.

06:36.880 --> 06:38.880
I'm totally beat!

06:38.880 --> 06:42.080
-You'll get paid nicely tonight.
-Really?

06:44.890 --> 06:46.960
Hey Tanaka-kun!

06:46.960 --> 06:50.230
There's a female customer
named Minami asking for you.

06:50.230 --> 06:53.030
Huh? Maho?

06:53.030 --> 06:55.030
She's quite cute.

06:55.030 --> 06:56.270
Your girlfriend?

06:56.270 --> 06:57.930
No...nothing like that.

07:06.910 --> 07:08.380
Hi!

07:14.920 --> 07:17.920
Hey, doesn't that boy look familiar?

07:17.920 --> 07:19.980
Huh?

07:22.430 --> 07:26.020
-He's the one in the drama.
-A-And that water commercial!

07:27.270 --> 07:31.100
-Ryusuke told me you worked here.
-Oh...

07:31.100 --> 07:33.270
You sure are working hard.

07:33.270 --> 07:36.370
Nah...Not really.

07:36.370 --> 07:40.140
Oh yeah, let me introduce you...
This is one of my classmates, Yoshito.

07:41.210 --> 07:46.050
We met once in Mi-chan's shop.
You're on TV, right? That's awesome.

07:47.720 --> 07:50.560
Hey Maho...this guy looks so dirty.

07:50.560 --> 07:52.350
You sure the food here is okay?

07:54.560 --> 07:57.730
-Koyuki, are you free on Monday?
-Why?

07:57.730 --> 08:00.060
It's Christine's birthday party.

08:00.060 --> 08:02.900
I wondered if you could come.

08:02.900 --> 08:05.400
Christine?

08:05.400 --> 08:06.400
What?

08:06.400 --> 08:10.340
I thought we were gonna have this party
only with friends from school.

08:10.340 --> 08:13.240
Why not? It's always more fun
with more people.

08:13.240 --> 08:16.080
What do you mean?
We already have enough people.

08:16.080 --> 08:18.070
Why are you so unhappy about it?

08:19.620 --> 08:24.450
-Wow! They're bilingual!
-And she's so pretty.

08:28.260 --> 08:30.760
They were eating the 5000-yen course.

08:30.760 --> 08:34.390
Hope they have money.

08:43.870 --> 08:47.330
And I can't even speak English.

08:49.050 --> 08:51.050
Hey kid!

08:51.050 --> 08:53.640
Quit daydreaming!

08:55.390 --> 08:57.180
I'm sorry!

08:59.890 --> 09:03.520
No, thank you so much! Good-bye!

09:05.900 --> 09:08.070
Every label turned us down?

09:08.070 --> 09:11.300
Our self-produced CD is a total disaster.

09:13.000 --> 09:15.170
We worked so hard on it.

09:17.070 --> 09:19.910
Ran's influence was worse than I expected.

09:19.910 --> 09:26.080
No one would come right out and say it,
but I could feel Ran's influence.

09:26.080 --> 09:29.750
Can we break through it? With our power?

09:29.750 --> 09:31.280
Ran...

09:35.930 --> 09:38.030
Lift up your heavy ass, now

09:38.030 --> 09:40.200
If you take off that stiff head

09:40.200 --> 09:41.800
You'll feel totally loose

09:41.800 --> 09:42.870
This crazy, crazy world

09:42.870 --> 09:46.700
-Well...the sound is still amateur...

09:42.870 --> 09:46.700
-You just have to Stage Dive or Die

09:46.700 --> 09:49.040
-but I do feel some good vibes from it

09:46.700 --> 09:49.040
-Mind blower, a shower of sweat

09:49.040 --> 09:51.600
even with a name like Beck.

09:56.380 --> 09:58.050
However...

09:58.050 --> 10:01.220
these guys will never make a major debut.

10:01.220 --> 10:02.550
It's unfortunate,

10:02.550 --> 10:06.720
but anyone who crosses me
will be destroyed!

10:06.720 --> 10:08.560
Ran-san...

10:08.560 --> 10:14.430
Eiji, in this world,
only the strongest survive.

10:27.410 --> 10:30.040
In this world, power is everything.

10:32.920 --> 10:34.940
And Ran-san has it.

10:38.190 --> 10:41.860
And someone powerless like me,
just has to be smart and get around it.

10:41.860 --> 10:43.630
That's the reality.

10:43.630 --> 10:49.830
But Ryusuke, I'll become successful
no matter what I have to do.

10:58.580 --> 11:01.380
Ah...On the sixteenth?

11:01.380 --> 11:04.220
I can't. I got a red flag.

11:04.220 --> 11:08.390
Come on, Maho. My father's friend
opened an Italian restaurant.

11:08.390 --> 11:11.750
You know, in nighttime,
the view from there is so great.

11:19.060 --> 11:21.070
All right, I'll think about it.

11:21.070 --> 11:22.830
Oh, I gotta go to bathroom.

11:24.570 --> 11:26.900
What kind of band is Beck?

11:26.900 --> 11:30.200
They put their live [performance]
Before anything else.

11:31.240 --> 11:33.740
Well, I just met the singer.

11:33.740 --> 11:34.870
And?

11:38.580 --> 11:40.850
He was just a tiny tot.

11:46.760 --> 11:48.930
Yes, hello?

11:48.930 --> 11:51.100
Oh, I dialed the wrong number.

11:51.100 --> 11:53.600
Oh, it's Koyuki-kun?

11:53.600 --> 11:56.430
Uh...Yes.

11:56.430 --> 11:59.440
Maho is taking a shower
and can't come to the phone.

11:59.440 --> 12:01.940
Anything you want me to tell her?

12:01.940 --> 12:03.610
Oh?

12:03.610 --> 12:07.110
About Monday's party.

12:07.110 --> 12:09.110
Oh, the party...

12:09.110 --> 12:13.780
Come to the party dressed
like you were invited to a ball.

12:13.780 --> 12:16.450
And don't forget the present for the guest.

12:16.450 --> 12:18.050
And who...

12:27.130 --> 12:29.220
Hey, what're you laughing about?

12:34.640 --> 12:37.000
You're kind, Koyuki.

12:38.740 --> 12:42.080
But you don't seem to like my friends.

12:42.080 --> 12:44.580
It's Christine's birthday party.

12:44.580 --> 12:47.280
I wondered if you could come.

13:23.120 --> 13:27.290
Hey you! This place is reserved today.

13:27.290 --> 13:29.960
Don't mess around here...please.

13:29.960 --> 13:35.130
Err...no...My friend is enjoy party.

13:35.130 --> 13:37.570
Ah! Yoshito-kun!

13:37.570 --> 13:42.910
Sorry, but plans were changed.
Now this party is only for school friends.

13:42.910 --> 13:44.910
That's...

13:44.910 --> 13:48.080
So others can't come in. Sorry.

13:48.080 --> 13:50.580
Oh...

13:50.580 --> 13:53.080
Please give this to Christine then.

13:53.080 --> 13:54.080
Sure.

13:54.080 --> 13:55.240
See ya!

14:10.270 --> 14:11.390
Why?!

14:13.100 --> 14:15.940
'Cause he really took it serious.

14:15.940 --> 14:17.930
He looked so stupid.

14:20.780 --> 14:22.340
Koyuki...

14:24.280 --> 14:26.580
Hey! He don't give a fuck!

15:51.570 --> 15:53.060
The Telecaster is gone.

15:58.240 --> 16:00.510
Takano-san said to wait in the back.

16:03.580 --> 16:05.250
Hey!

16:05.250 --> 16:07.050
Hey! Wait!

16:08.250 --> 16:10.590
Takano-san wants...

16:10.590 --> 16:12.210
Hey!

16:14.430 --> 16:17.090
T-Thief!

16:17.090 --> 16:18.080
Huh?

16:20.100 --> 16:22.930
Takano...

16:22.930 --> 16:24.700
Crush!

16:44.220 --> 16:49.230
Katahira-san, how is that Telecaster?
I made lots of adjustments.

16:49.230 --> 16:51.060
Katahira...

16:51.060 --> 16:55.400
Ohh...It's nice. I wanna buy it.

16:55.400 --> 16:58.740
Huh? It's Tatsuya Katahira
of Loud Crime City.

16:58.740 --> 17:01.410
Can't do that. This kid's gonna buy it.

17:01.410 --> 17:03.410
I'll pay you double.

17:03.410 --> 17:09.180
-I didn't reserve it...
-No, Taira asked me.

17:10.480 --> 17:11.920
Oh...

17:11.920 --> 17:16.350
I'm a drummer, but I've gotta be nice
and give guitars a chance, too.

17:18.260 --> 17:21.590
If that kid doesn't buy it, let me know.

17:26.100 --> 17:29.330
Is Loud really going to disband
after their next live performance?

17:31.100 --> 17:34.270
Yup. You gotta know when to call it quits.

17:34.270 --> 17:37.540
Come watch us.

17:37.540 --> 17:41.880
Kid, the deadline is
the end of the month. Got it?

17:41.880 --> 17:43.010
Yes!

17:44.210 --> 17:47.220
Hmm...Katahira of Loud?

17:47.220 --> 17:48.220
Yup...

17:48.220 --> 17:51.720
It's true that Loud
is Japan's top rock band.

17:51.720 --> 17:54.060
Let's go see them at the Budokan.

17:54.060 --> 17:57.060
Stupid! It was sold out ages ago.

17:57.060 --> 18:00.560
Hah! So different from us.

18:00.560 --> 18:04.070
Loud wasn't popular from the start.

18:04.070 --> 18:05.930
Let's just concentrate on today's show.

18:07.400 --> 18:10.240
Right! Live performances are important.

18:12.240 --> 18:15.750
But our problem right now is...

18:15.750 --> 18:17.240
This!

18:18.420 --> 18:22.420
We ordered 300 copies
and we have 210 left.

18:22.420 --> 18:24.420
That's 42 copies each!

18:24.420 --> 18:28.260
Friends, family, anyone you
can think of! Sell them all!

18:28.260 --> 18:31.760
B-But I don't know 40 people!

18:31.760 --> 18:35.600
If we don't get rid of these,
we'll end up with a huge debt!

18:35.600 --> 18:36.530
-Oh...
-Oh...
-Oh...

18:41.210 --> 18:44.800
Yo! We're Beck!

18:46.210 --> 18:50.010
It's packed tonight,
but there's not much noise.

18:50.010 --> 18:52.220
They're all waiting for the next band.

18:52.220 --> 18:56.050
We should pump them up.

18:56.050 --> 18:57.580
One, two...

19:07.900 --> 19:09.020
Uh!

19:10.070 --> 19:11.360
Yeah!

19:14.570 --> 19:18.080
You open up the door
with negative aura

19:18.080 --> 19:19.910
You say future is murky indeed...

19:19.910 --> 19:22.750
I'm sick of hearing gripe.

19:22.750 --> 19:24.920
Open up the door with negative aura

19:24.920 --> 19:26.080
If you never change

19:26.080 --> 19:29.920
It's probably the last time
I'll use this in a live performance.

19:26.080 --> 19:29.920
I think there is no way
my life fizzle out

19:29.920 --> 19:32.320
Thank you for all this time...
White Falcon.

19:33.590 --> 19:36.090
You open up the door with negative aura

19:36.090 --> 19:37.030
(I'm fed up fed up fed up)

19:37.030 --> 19:41.370
When Loud disbands,
Japanese rock will die.

19:37.030 --> 19:41.370
You say future is murky...

19:41.370 --> 19:45.040
And that's not an understatement.

19:45.040 --> 19:49.210
It's fact that Loud has carried
the Japanese scene on its shoulders.

19:49.210 --> 19:51.540
Really?

19:51.540 --> 19:56.240
And there's been no band
that can compare to Loud.

19:59.550 --> 20:01.550
Our gas ran out.

20:01.550 --> 20:02.720
Huh?

20:02.720 --> 20:06.390
We can't run anymore.

20:06.390 --> 20:07.560
You must know...

20:07.560 --> 20:10.030
In the music scene,
something's always evolving.

20:12.400 --> 20:17.730
Somewhere right now, there's an
unknown band making great music.

20:17.730 --> 20:19.240
Is there such a band?

20:19.240 --> 20:21.910
No one knows about them yet,

20:21.910 --> 20:24.040
but they'll come onto the next music scene

20:24.040 --> 20:26.530
and let us listen to the real McCoy.

20:31.250 --> 20:32.150
See ya!

20:34.420 --> 20:36.150
Katahira-san!

20:39.360 --> 20:40.360
Don't chain down your affection

20:40.360 --> 20:41.190
Awaken primal feeling

20:41.190 --> 20:42.190
Don't benumb emotion

20:42.190 --> 20:43.230
Sing out primal scream

20:43.230 --> 20:47.500
Let loose every feeling
from joy to grief

20:47.500 --> 20:48.370
Don't chain down your affection

20:48.370 --> 20:49.530
Awaken primal feeling

20:49.530 --> 20:50.130
Don't benumb emotion

20:50.130 --> 20:51.540
Sing out primal scream

20:51.540 --> 20:55.370
Let loose every feeling
from joy to grief

20:55.370 --> 20:56.310
Don't chain down your affection

20:56.310 --> 20:57.310
Awaken primal feeling

20:57.310 --> 20:58.140
Don't benumb emotion

20:58.140 --> 20:59.310
Sing out primal scream

20:59.310 --> 21:00.880
Let loose every feeling
from joy to grief

21:00.880 --> 21:03.710
He's gotten pretty good...that kid.

21:00.880 --> 21:03.710
Let loose every feeling
from joy to grief

21:03.710 --> 21:07.550
Go against headwind
or ride on the tailwind.

21:07.550 --> 21:08.720
Game is in your hands.

21:08.720 --> 21:10.550
How do you play?

21:10.550 --> 21:13.790
Follow your brainstorm!

21:52.430 --> 21:54.770
Could I get the CD?

21:54.770 --> 21:58.440
Uh, yes. The band's called Beck.

21:58.440 --> 22:00.740
Yes, a good band.

22:00.740 --> 22:02.940
Especially guitar.

22:02.940 --> 22:04.070
Yes!

22:05.110 --> 22:08.110
The president of an
Indies label in Chicago?

22:08.110 --> 22:11.280
Yup! It seems he just walked in by chance.

22:11.280 --> 22:14.280
Well, there are lots
of foreigners around here.

22:14.280 --> 22:15.620
Hmm...

22:20.620 --> 22:24.960
Sun Factory Record...Frank Albin.

22:24.960 --> 22:27.460
Never heard of it.

22:27.460 --> 22:31.470
-Is it all right?
-He seemed nice.

22:31.470 --> 22:34.060
All right. Cheers!

22:50.350 --> 22:52.460
Another minute

22:52.460 --> 22:55.150
Feelin' so fine

22:57.460 --> 22:59.700
You turn the freeze

22:59.700 --> 23:02.430
into warm light

23:04.530 --> 23:08.000
Had a premonition

23:08.000 --> 23:10.670
I've been waitin' ever since

23:10.670 --> 23:14.180
My world comin' down

23:14.180 --> 23:16.980
It's got me spinnin' 'round

23:18.750 --> 23:24.920
If you really wanna fly

23:24.920 --> 23:27.690
you gotta let go

23:39.940 --> 23:42.270
Simply the most

23:42.270 --> 23:44.310
big sensation

23:44.310 --> 23:47.110
(once you're here you won't go back)

23:47.110 --> 23:49.380
She's really pretty

23:49.380 --> 23:51.380
One-eyed vision

23:51.380 --> 23:54.220
(lose the fear it don't come back)

23:54.220 --> 23:57.720
Little sister showed me

23:57.720 --> 24:00.390
Really took me for a ride

24:00.390 --> 24:02.060
My world comin' down

24:02.060 --> 24:05.400
(once you're here you won't go back)

24:05.400 --> 24:09.420
(lose the fear it don't come back)

24:13.470 --> 24:16.210
I bought bags for the dog's poo.

24:16.210 --> 24:20.140
"Live 17 'Three Days'"

24:16.210 --> 24:20.140
Why do I hafta walk Beck?! Ryusuke!
